{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-muraba-veil","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"muraba-veil-muraba-properties-al-wasl","about":"Muraba Veil, Dubai Canal, Dubai, United Arab Emirates, is set to transform Dubai’s skyline with its extraordinary design, becoming the second-thinnest skyscraper in the world. Standing at an impressive height of 1,247 feet but only 74 feet wide, it redefines luxury living with a slender silhouette that houses a single apartment per floor. The exterior is wrapped in a custom-designed stainless steel “veil” that not only enhances the building’s sleek, modern look but also serves as a functional feature to optimize privacy while allowing natural light to flood the interiors. This innovative facade captures the changing colors of the sky, creating a dynamic, ever-evolving visual experience.Strategically located along Sheikh Zayed Road and overlooking the Dubai Canal, Muraba Veil at Al Wasl by Muraba Properties offers a collection of 131 luxurious apartments with two to five bedrooms. Inspired by traditional Arabian architecture, the residences are arranged around internal courtyards enriched with greenery, providing a serene retreat in the heart of the city. The project includes exclusive amenities such as a spa, a private movie theater, a gallery, a restaurant, and even a padel court, ensuring a holistic lifestyle that blends culture, luxury, and modern convenience.","price":12000000,"title":"Muraba Veil","bitrix":{"id":915,"pf_id":"are.2.14152","source":null,"project_id":"Muraba Veil","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Muraba Veil","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Muraba Properties","project_location":"Al Wasl"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Muraba_Veil_at_Al_Wasl_by_Muraba_Properties_b1bacc53d1.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Muraba_Veil_at_Al_Wasl_by_Muraba_Propertie